===Etymology===
From {{inh|it|ML.|brūnus}} "brown, brunet" (whence also {{cog|es|bruno}}, {{cog|fr|brun}}), from {{der|it|frk||*brūn}}, from {{der|it|gem-pro|*brūnaz||brown}}, from {{der|it|ine-pro|*bher-|t=shining, brown}}. Akin to {{cog|odt|brūn}} "brown" ({{cog|nl|bruin}} "brown"), {{cog|goh|brūn}} "brown" ({{cog|de|braun}} "brown"), {{cog|ang|brūn}} "brown". More at {{l|en|brown}}.

